   "id": "18167053015481391",
   "caption": "Good rag, bad rag, what’s the fuss?\n\nI love the visual and academic connections between text and textile, threading and leading. To whoever came up with this metaphor, I owe a big thank-you. It really makes typesetting fun.\n\n“Bad rag” is a program that distorts the rag and allows the user to manually fray the edges like a real cloth.",
